Voice Support (Deutsch) builds the Voice Support app by the Open Home
Foundation (https://github.com/OHF-Voice/app-voice-support), licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. The app's source is downloaded unchanged at
build time; this directory adds a German wake word configuration
(wake.de.yaml, derived from the app's wake.yaml), a start script and the
build recipe.

The German acoustic model (de_DE-zamia) and the Kaldi/OpenFST tools come
from rhasspy-speech (https://huggingface.co/datasets/rhasspy/rhasspy-speech)
under their own licenses.
